Outfits are the main way to gain Willpower for heists in The Burgle Cats. They can be obtained from Outfit Chests and from the [[The Burgle Cats/Shop|Market]]'s daily deals.

Each outfit also ties with one or multiple snack types, if the Cat's favorite snack matches with any of the outfit's tied snacks, the Cat will gain an additional 5% Willpower. Some outfits has additional Premium skin with an extra passive effect in battles.

