==Trivia==
*The Traveller's Gear resembles Goku's outfit from ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Ball|Dragon Ball]]''.
*Dad's Belly-band is a reference to Bakabon's Papa's iconic look from [[wikipedia:Tensai Bakabon|''Tensai Bakabon'']], which is proven by how it's meant to pair with the [[The Burgle Cats/Accessories|Hip Headband]].
*The Trendy Overalls are most likely a reference to the titular character of the ''[[wikipedia:Mario (franchise)|Mario]]'' franchise, as they were seemingly made to pair with the Cool Red Cap.
*The Celebrity Gown is based on the dress worn by [[wikipedia:Marilyn Monroe|Marilyn Monroe]] in ''[[wikipedia:The Seven Year Itch|The Seven Year Itch]]''.
*The Bunny Suit is a reference to the suits worn by Playboy Bunny girls, with the matching ears supporting this further.
